message: "If you use Aero Agent Roles in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Aero Agent Roles"
abstract: >-
  Open library of professional engineering roles for AI agents, built on
  Aero Agent Skills. Each role binds verified skills into end-to-end
  deliverables (certification plans, compliance matrices, audit reports),
  published by Ashforde OÜ under Apache-2.0. Standards are referenced and
  summarized, never reproduced.
